{"cluster_id": "C-2794", "topic": "If an old append CAS commits before recovery fencing", "target": "architecture/mounts-and-leases", "member_ids": ["B041-084"], "canonical_claim": "If an old append CAS commits before recovery fencing, recovery rereads and adopts the node; if the fence commits first, the old CAS is permanently invalid because its expected token is stale.", "issue_ids": [], "sources": ["docs/superpowers/reports/2026-07-28-ref-rework-reviews/codex_simplify_design.md#L166-L171"]}
