{"cluster_id": "C-2812", "topic": "The CaDiskLifecycle TLA+ model's v1 state", "target": "architecture/mounts-and-leases", "member_ids": ["B050-066"], "canonical_claim": "The `CaDiskLifecycle` TLA+ model's v1 state machine contains `Live`, `Transient`, `IdentityLost`, `VanishedReplaced`, and `VanishedForgotten`; it has no `VanishedErased` state.", "issue_ids": ["T15", "rev.8"], "sources": [".superpowers/sdd/tla-rev7-report.md#L13-L23"]}
